# Unit22
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit22核心词汇

island/ˈaɪlənd/岛/Hainan is a beautiful island in southern China.
isolate/ˈaɪsəleɪt/隔离；孤立/The patient was isolated to prevent infection.
issue/ˈɪʃuː/问题；发行/Climate change is an important issue today.
item/ˈaɪtəm/项目；物品/Please check each item on the list.
jacket/ˈdʒækɪt/夹克/He wore a leather jacket.
jail/dʒeɪl/监狱/He was sent to jail for robbery.
jam/dʒæm/果酱；堵塞/There was a traffic jam on the highway.
job/dʒɑːb/工作/She is looking for a new job.
join/dʒɔɪn/加入/Would you like to join our team?
joke/dʒoʊk/笑话/He told a funny joke at the party.
journal/ˈdʒɜːrnl/期刊；日志/She published her research in a scientific journal.
journey/ˈdʒɜːrni/旅程/The journey from Beijing to Shanghai takes five hours by train.
joy/dʒɔɪ/欢乐/Children's laughter brings joy to everyone.
judge/dʒʌdʒ/判断；法官/The judge sentenced the criminal to ten years in prison.
jump/dʒʌmp/跳/The cat jumped onto the table.
junior/ˈdʒuːniər/初级的/He is a junior employee in the company.
jury/ˈdʒʊri/陪审团/The jury found the defendant not guilty.
just/dʒʌst/公正的；刚刚/A judge should be fair and just.
justice/ˈdʒʌstɪs/正义/We should fight for justice.
justify/ˈdʒʌstɪfaɪ/证明…正当/How can you justify such behavior?
keen/kiːn/热切的；敏锐的/She is keen on learning new languages.
keep/kiːp/保持/Keep quiet in the library, please.
key/kiː/钥匙；关键/Communication is the key to a good relationship.
kick/kɪk/踢/He kicked the ball into the goal.
kid/kɪd/小孩/The kids are playing in the yard.
kill/kɪl/杀死/The hunter killed a deer.
kind/kaɪnd/善良的；种类/She is a very kind person.
king/kɪŋ/国王/The king ruled the country wisely.
kingdom/ˈkɪŋdəm/王国/The animal kingdom is full of wonders.
kitchen/ˈkɪtʃɪn/厨房/She is cooking in the kitchen.
knee/niː/膝盖/He fell and hurt his knee.
knife/naɪf/刀/She cut the bread with a knife.
knock/nɑːk/敲/Someone is knocking at the door.
know/noʊ/知道/I know the answer to this question.
knowledge/ˈnɑːlɪdʒ/知识/Knowledge is power.
lab/læb/实验室/He works in a chemistry lab.
label/ˈleɪbl/标签/Read the label before taking the medicine.
lack/læk/缺乏/He lacks confidence in public speaking.
ladder/ˈlædər/梯子/He climbed the ladder to fix the roof.
lady/ˈleɪdi/女士/A young lady walked into the room.
lake/leɪk/湖/We went boating on the lake.
land/lænd/土地；着陆/The plane landed safely at the airport.
landscape/ˈlændskeɪp/风景/The landscape in this area is breathtaking.
language/ˈlæŋɡwɪdʒ/语言/English is a widely spoken language.
lap/læp/膝盖；一圈/She sat with the cat on her lap.
large/lɑːrdʒ/大的/China is a large country with a long history.
last/læst/最后的；持续/How long will the meeting last?
late/leɪt/迟的/She was late for school this morning.
later/ˈleɪtər/后来/I'll call you later.
laugh/læf/笑/Everyone laughed at his joke.
